      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you clarify why we should use the client.hpp APIs here?\nI used the existing ipmid utils because they work with the ipmi::Context and match the other handlers.\nipmi::getManagedObjects/setDbusProperty(ctx, ...) call ctx-\u003ebus-\u003eyield_method_call with ctx-\u003eyield, so the D-Bus calls are already non-blocking.",
