      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T09:01:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\nThe `client.hpp` API requires a `sdbusplus::async::context`, which ipmid doesn\u0027t provide. Using it would require creating a local context and blocking in `ctx.run()` until the `Set` operation completes. This would stall ipmid\u0027s single-threaded `io_context` preventing it from processing other IPMI requests.",
      "parentUuid": "56532aa4_7155c733",
      "revId": "e4911a7cf090c44526bbfefdcd4bd6024901679c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
